 {"timestamp": "2026-04-15T14:29:47Z", "username": "AntNishu", "text": "Q3: Back home, X is widely known as \"Solillada Saradara\"(The Unbeaten Leader), thanks to X's remarkable streak of 10 consecutive election wins, an unbeaten run that lasted until 2019.\nAt just 7, X survived a horrific 1948 incident in which his mother, sister were killed in a fire set by Razakars. X was whisked away to safety by his father as they fled through nearby fields and forests to escape.\nWhat's unfortunate is that this deeply personal tragedy was later dragged into political mudslinging. Y(as expected of him) brought it up to target X politically, claiming X avoids the topic to not upset Muslim voters.\nX's son pushed back strongly, telling Y to take his hate politics elsewhere and emphasising that despite the tragedy, X never exploited it for political gain and never let hatred define him.\nID X,Y", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-15T14:30:03Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "Kharge", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-15T14:30:06Z", "username": "Chinmay Mehta", "text": "Yogi", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-15T14:30:06Z", "username": "Srijan Naayak", "text": "Yogi", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-15T14:30:10Z", "username": "Das", "text": "Bangladesh Om", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-15T14:30:14Z", "username": "Das", "text": "Hasina", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-15T14:30:46Z", "username": "Smit D Mahajani", "text": "Oh damn", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-15T14:31:01Z", "username": "AntNishu", "text": "correct answer: X: Mallikarjun Kh